{"strongs": "H2721", "word": "חֹ֫רֶב", "translit": "cho.rev", "root": "חרא", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "dryness, drought, heat", "definition": "I. חֹ֫רֶב noun masculine Gen 31:40 dryness, drought, heat , absolute ׳ ח Gen 31:40 + 11 t. + Deut 28:22 (for ᵑ0 חֶרֶב ; see Di , followed by ᵑ9 ; ᵐ5 and ᵐ5 L omitted); — 1. dryness Judg 6:37 ; Judg 6:39 ; Judg 6:40 (all of absence of dew); Jer 50:38 (|| יָבֵשׁ ); so read also Zech 11:17 (for ᵑ0 חֶרֶב , see v b and Sta ZAW i. 1881, 29 ), a drying up upon his arm (i.e. a withering ) and upon his right eye . 2. drought Hag 1:11 + Deut 28:22 see above 3. parching heat (of sun) Gen 31:40 (opposed to קֶ֫רַח ), Jer 36:30 (opposed to id. ); Isa 4:6 ; Isa 25:4 ; Isa 25:5 (twice in verse); of fever Job 30:30 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3086')\">BDB3086</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2721')\">H2721</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3085')\">BDB3085</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3087')\">BDB3087</entry></div><p> I. <bdbheb>חֹ֫רֶב</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Gen 31:40\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"40\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"40\" onclick=\"bcv(1,31,40)\">Gen 31:40</ref></sup> <highlightword>dryness, drought, heat</highlightword>, absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 31:40\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"40\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"40\" onclick=\"bcv(1,31,40)\">Gen 31:40</ref> + 11 t. + <ref ref=\"Deut 28:22\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(5,28,22)\">Deut 28:22</ref> (for <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('MT')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ0</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <bdbheb>חֶרֶב</bdbheb>; see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup>, followed by <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Vg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ9</reflink></bdbheb></lookup>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> and <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb><sup><reflink>L</reflink></sup></lookup> omitted); — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>dryness</highlight> <ref ref=\"Judg 6:37\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(7,6,37)\">Judg 6:37</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 6:39\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"39\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"39\" onclick=\"bcv(7,6,39)\">Judg 6:39</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 6:40\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"40\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"40\" onclick=\"bcv(7,6,40)\">Judg 6:40</ref> (all of absence of dew); <ref ref=\"Jer 50:38\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(24,50,38)\">Jer 50:38</ref> (|| <bdbheb>יָבֵשׁ</bdbheb>); so read also <ref ref=\"Zech 11:17\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(38,11,17)\">Zech 11:17</ref> (for <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('MT')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ0</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <bdbheb>חֶרֶב</bdbheb>, see v<sup>b and</sup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sta')\">Sta<sup>ZAW i. 1881, 29</sup></lookup>), <highlight>a drying up upon his arm</highlight> (i.e. a <highlight>withering</highlight>) <highlight>and upon his right eye</highlight>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>drought</highlight> <ref ref=\"Hag 1:11\" b=\"37\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(37,1,11)\">Hag 1:11</ref> + <ref ref=\"Deut 28:22\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(5,28,22)\">Deut 28:22</ref> see above </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>parching heat</highlight> (of sun) <ref ref=\"Gen 31:40\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"40\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"40\" onclick=\"bcv(1,31,40)\">Gen 31:40</ref> (opposed to <bdbheb>קֶ֫רַח</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Jer 36:30\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(24,36,30)\">Jer 36:30</ref> (opposed to <highlight>id.</highlight>); <ref ref=\"Isa 4:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,4,6)\">Isa 4:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 25:4\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(23,25,4)\">Isa 25:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 25:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,25,5)\">Isa 25:5</ref> (twice in verse); of fever <ref ref=\"Job 30:30\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(18,30,30)\">Job 30:30</ref>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Gen 31:40", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 31, "verse": 40}, {"raw": "Deut 28:22", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 28, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "Judg 6:37", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 6, "verse": 37}, {"raw": "Judg 6:39", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 6, "verse": 39}, {"raw": "Judg 6:40", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 6, "verse": 40}, {"raw": "Jer 50:38", "book": "JER", "chapter": 50, "verse": 38}, {"raw": "Zech 11:17", "book": "ZEC", "chapter": 11, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Hag 1:11", "book": "HAG", "chapter": 1, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Jer 36:30", "book": "JER", "chapter": 36, "verse": 30}, {"raw": "Isa 4:6", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 4, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Isa 25:4", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 25, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Isa 25:5", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 25, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Job 30:30", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 30, "verse": 30}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["חֹ֫רֶב", "׳", "ח", "ᵑ0", "חֶרֶב", "ᵑ9", "ᵐ5", "יָבֵשׁ", "קֶ֫רַח"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": ["Di", "MT", "Sept", "Sta", "Vg"]}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB3086", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}